# Policy changes are approved by Git pull-request review (see docs/policy/README.md).
# Syntax is GitHub/GitLab CODEOWNERS; replace the placeholder handles with real teams.
# Last matching pattern wins.

# Default: security owns all policy.
/policy/                    @org/security-policy

# Global rules (tier ladder, capability -> tier) need security AND platform.
/policy/global.yaml         @org/security-policy @org/platform

# Team budgets and model allowlists: finance-ops must approve spending changes.
/policy/teams/              @org/security-policy @org/finops

# Agent definitions: owning team lead plus security.
/policy/agents/hr-agent.yaml               @org/security-policy @org/hr-leads
/policy/agents/finance-recon-agent.yaml    @org/security-policy @org/finance-leads
/policy/agents/coding-agent.yaml           @org/security-policy @org/eng-leads

# Trust anchors (public signing keys): the most sensitive file in the repo.
/policy/trust/              @org/security-policy @org/platform
